  m_text: "<size=150%><b>9 \xB7 VFX: Particles</b></size>\nThe few settings that make an effect. The finished effects are in Particle-Effects.\n\n1 Where particles are born, and how many \xB7 2 Lifetime, speed and gravity \xB7 3 Size and colour over lifetime \xB7 4 Lit or Unlit, Alpha or Additive \xB7 5 Collision and a splash where a drop lands"
